Dear colleagues,

On behalf of local organizers Artur Pokropek and colleagues, we are pleased to announce that the next Meeting of the SEM Working Group will take place in Warsaw from 15-17 April 2026.

At a glance:

Prof. Yves Rosseel (Ghent University) has once again graciously agreed to offer a pre-conference workshop on 15 April
