The Meeting will be hosted by Educational Research Institute – National Research Institute (IBE) and the Institute of Philosophy and Sociology, Polish Academy of Sciences (IFiS PAN)

More details (programme, venue, registration) as well as the Call for Papers will follow soon.

If you know other colleagues who may be interested in the 2026 meeting, send them to this site: https://www.tu-chemnitz.de/hsw/soziologie/Professuren/Empirische_Sozialforschung/SEM/news.php <https://eur04.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.tu-chemnitz.de%2Fhsw%2Fsoziologie%2FProfessuren%2FEmpirische_Sozialforschung%2FSEM%2Fnews.php&data=05%...%40uva.nl%7C9add42bc0ced43808b7108ddefa10678%7Ca0f1cacd618c4403b94576fb3d6874e5%7C0%7C0%7C638930197063493212%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&sdata=k4mc6Z%2F3OryRk99sbl3fB8VBId4yBp3ajYpNevVuIxA%3D&reserved=0>to sign up for the newsletter.

